Track 1: The Flour Bloom
- Story & Context: In the sterile conditions of Vault 7, young botanist Lena discovered a single, impossibly vibrant blue bloom pushing through a crack in the concrete floor, its petals pulsating with an eerie light, an anomaly that sparked the first improvised song among her colleagues. "This isn't just a flower, it's a defiant prayer."
