Track 3: Risotto Protocol
- Story & Context: After the "Great Fungus Scare of '38," where a rogue spore threatened the entire rice archive, the vault crew collectively decided that the only way to truly honor their charge was to occasionally, ritualistically, cook a massive, celebratory risotto from a single, carefully selected grain, turning fear into a shared, joyful sustenance. "Every grain a story, every spoon a testament."
